# Perilous Snare: "When this artifact enters, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until this artifact
# leaves the battlefield." Bot1's own Mox Pearl and Bot2's Island (a land) are refused as targets; Bot2's Ornithopter is
# exiled, the positive control (CR 610.3). Bot1's speed became 1 as the Snare entered (start your engines!, CR 704.5aa).
# When Disenchant destroys the Snare, the Ornithopter returns (CR 610.3a), and Bot1 keeps its speed: nothing decreases
# it, and the permanent that gave it leaving changes nothing (the rulings).

